  "summary": {
    "zh": "公开 catalog 新增 1.1.0（31 条规则与 10 个模板）：zh/en 双语文字与 trigger / purpose / exclude，行为语义与 1.0.0 一致；两个场景模板另声明常驻集合与四个按需标签（decisions、files、reports、maintenance），选择它们时 profile 预览生成 schema 2.2 的标签加载声明，经确认后才生效，--no-tags 保持完整读取。既有项目不会自动变化，可用 updates 查看并经完整预览确认升级。",
    "en": "The public catalog gains 1.1.0 (31 rules and 10 templates): zh/en text with trigger / purpose / exclude, behaviourally identical to 1.0.0. The two scenario templates also declare a resident set and four on-demand tags (decisions, files, reports, maintenance); selecting them makes the profile preview generate a schema 2.2 tag-loading declaration that only takes effect after confirmation, and --no-tags keeps full reading. Existing projects do not change automatically; updates lists the new versions and the upgrade needs a full preview and confirmation."
